HeaderInclude
config/jrisc/jrisc-opts.h

mcpu=
Target RejectNegative Joined Enum(jrisc_cpu) Var(jrisc_cpu) Init(JRISC_CPU_GPU)
-mcpu=CPU	Generate code for the TOM GPU (tom, gpu) or the JERRY DSP (jerry, dsp).

Enum
Name(jrisc_cpu) Type(enum jrisc_cpu_type)
Known Jaguar RISC processors (for use with the -mcpu= option):

EnumValue
Enum(jrisc_cpu) String(gpu) Value(JRISC_CPU_GPU)

EnumValue
Enum(jrisc_cpu) String(tom) Value(JRISC_CPU_GPU)

EnumValue
Enum(jrisc_cpu) String(dsp) Value(JRISC_CPU_DSP)

EnumValue
Enum(jrisc_cpu) String(jerry) Value(JRISC_CPU_DSP)

mgpu
Target RejectNegative Alias(mcpu=, gpu)
Generate code for the TOM GPU.

mdsp
Target RejectNegative Alias(mcpu=, dsp)
Generate code for the JERRY DSP.
